Notes:
An upcoming episode of Sesame Street, featuring SZA as a guest, is set to appear in the next season of the television program. An excerpt from the episode was shared on Instagram by the official Cookie Monster account on 3/9/2024. SZA has a song for this episode respectively, and it's unknown what the title is.

@cookiemonster via Instagram post (3/9/2024):
"Me loved having you on our Street, @SZA! Let me know which type of cookies are your favorite for next time. 🍪"
